### fiscal-fr MCP server — Auth API token flow
### Prerequisite: run `npm run dev:http` in `mcp-server/`

//@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333
@baseUrl = https://kalifa.happykiller.net
@mcpPath = /mcp

# Remplacer par un compte valide present dans src/data/users.db.json
@email = fabrice@example.com
@password = changeme

### 1. Récupérer un token via l'API du portal (réponse JSON)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/token-portal
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Store Token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### 2. Tester le token sur le endpoint MCP
POST {{baseUrl}}{{mcpPath}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}
